<title>Furqan Aura - AI Article Writing Studio</title>
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Segoe UI,sans-serif}
body{background:#fffaf6;color:#333}
header{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ff6a00,#ff9a44);color:white;padding:60px 20px;text-align:center}
.btn{display:inline-block;background:white;color:#ff6a00;padding:14px 28px;border-radius:30px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;margin-top:20px}
section{max-width:1000px;margin:auto;padding:50px 20px}
h2{text-align:center;font-size:28px;margin-bottom:30px;color:#ff6a00}
.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr));gap:20px}
.card{background:white;border-radius:16px;padding:25px;box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.07);border-top:4px solid #ff6a00}
footer{background:#222;color:#ccc;text-align:center;padding:25px;margin-top:30px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<h1>Furqan Aura</h1>
<p>AI Article Writing Studio - SEO & Human Friendly Articles</p>
<p>100% Plagiarism Free | Google Ranking | Fast Delivery</p>
