</header>
<section>
<h2>Our Services</h2>
<div class="cards">
<div class="card"><h3>✍️ SEO Blog Articles</h3><p>Google par rank karne wale 100% SEO optimized articles.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>🤖 AI + Human Touch</h3><p>AI safe, natural articles jo AI detector se bach jayen.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>📈 Affiliate Articles</h3><p>Amazon, Health, Tech, Finance har niche ke liye articles.</p></div>
</div>
</section>
<section style="background:#fff2e8;border-radius:20px;padding:30px">
